Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 10:15:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223: ZepEquipModels - item models on the textured
 slots (F-211)

Source port of the wxl-equip-extension fork, same ItemDisplayInfo data model
(Model:geosets, Icon2 attach1:attach2:flags:folder). Collections attach with
attachToRoot, filter geosets per instance and copy matched character bones
after the scene animates. Verified on the Orgrimmar gate grunts (3296).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ByrZ7GxoHC9wfGdkRwtqCX
---
 .../ZepEquipModels/src/ZepEquipModels.cpp     | 591 ++++++++++++++++++
